## DO NOT
- ❌ Suggest downgrading Node.js or package versions
- ❌ Use Options API (only Composition API with `<script setup>`)
- ❌ Use `any` type in TypeScript
- ❌ Add custom CSS without Tailwind utility consideration
- ❌ Create components without proper TypeScript typing
- ❌ Skip responsive design testing
- ❌ Ignore accessibility requirements
- ❌ Use deprecated Tailwind v3 syntax with v4 installed

## ALWAYS DO
- ✅ Use Node.js 24 (`nvm use 24` if needed)
- ✅ Type all props, emits, and function parameters
- ✅ Test on mobile devices/viewports
- ✅ Use semantic HTML elements
- ✅ Follow the brand color palette
- ✅ Include loading and error states
- ✅ Validate TypeScript before committing
- ✅ Keep components focused and reusable
- ✅ Document complex logic with comments
- ✅ Optimize for performance and bundle size

